WEBVTT

00:11:57.777 --> 00:12:00.850
She took on six men in her primary,
she beat them all,

00:12:00.874 --> 00:12:02.257
she won the general election,

00:12:02.281 --> 00:12:04.234
and when she goes to Congress in January,

00:12:04.258 --> 00:12:06.836
she's going to be the first
African-American woman ever

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:08.855
to serve her district in Washington, D.C.

00:12:08.879 --> 00:12:12.009
(Applause and cheers)

00:12:12.033 --> 00:12:15.255
So women are recognizing --

00:12:15.279 --> 00:12:16.699
this is our moment.

00:12:16.723 --> 00:12:17.962
Don't wait for permission,

00:12:17.986 --> 00:12:19.829
don't wait for your turn.

00:12:20.859 --> 00:12:24.388
As the late, great
Shirley Chisholm said --

00:12:24.412 --> 00:12:26.984
Shirley Chisholm, the first
African-American woman ever

00:12:27.008 --> 00:12:28.276
to go to Congress

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:32.023
and the first woman to run for president
in the Democratic party --